@base = http://localhost:8080

### Login válido (200)
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "joao", "senha": "joao123"}

### Login inválido (401) - repetir duas vezes bloqueia o usuário
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "senha": "errada"}

### Troca de senha (público)
PUT {{base}}/trocarsenha/joao
Content-Type: application/json

{"atual": "joao123", "nova": "joao456"}

### Cadastro de usuário (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
POST {{base}}/
Authorization: Basic manutencao:manut123
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "senha": "ana123"}

### Lista de usuários (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
GET {{base}}/
Authorization: Basic manutencao:manut123

### Desbloqueio (ROLE_ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/unlock/maria
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123

### Desbloqueio com operador sem a role ADMIN (403)
PUT {{base}}/unlock/maria
Authorization: Basic manutencao:manut123

### Métricas
GET {{base}}/actuator/prometheus
